\n- **2026-09-02**: Evan - Signing Cert Missing (Active)\\n\\n - *Found that Windows Defender/SmartScreen blocks the unsigned build because a code-signing certificate is still missing; task remains active.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 39 sourc id src cu ciph 39 task id ciph 39 titl fix window build and clear defend smartscreen sign status activ assigne evan prioriti high date creat 2026 08 08 descript make the redact suit compat with window includ build packag a window build artifact now exist but window defend smartscreen block the unsign build becaus a code sign certif is still miss the task remain activ pend that certif clickup task ciph 39 sourc id src cu ciph 39 task id ciph 39 titl fix window build and clear defend smartscreen sign status activ assigne evan prioriti high date creat 2026 08 08 accept criterion window build artifact is produc success build is code sign with a valid certif so it is not block by defend smartscreen sign build pass window defend smartscreen without warn clickup task ciph 39 sourc id src cu ciph 39 task id ciph 39 titl fix window build and clear defend smartscreen sign status activ assigne evan prioriti high date creat 2026 08 08 descript make the redact suit compat with window includ build packag a window build artifact now exist but window defend smartscreen block the unsign build becaus a code sign certif is still miss the task remain activ pend that certif clickup task ciph 39 sourc id src cu ciph 39 task id ciph 39 titl fix window build and clear defend smartscreen sign status activ assigne evan prioriti high date creat 2026 08 08 activ histori 2026 08 08 alic task creat open open the task becaus window o compat is requir for the releas gate 2026 09 02 evan sign cert miss activ found that window defend smartscreen block the unsign build becaus a code sign certif is still miss task remain activ\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e95e78f48a9a11f19