: \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2735926426176638, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.08301260373951977, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7182794, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-15-Docker-Packaging.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e97bc1488a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-15-Docker-Packaging.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-15-Docker-Packaging.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1231, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:25\", \"token_count\": 678, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-26\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Title**: Audit Trail Logging\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBuild an audit-trail system for the redaction pipeline that captures a SHA-256 hash of each input stream together with a companion JSON document recording the redaction map applied to that file, then wire this audit-log generation into the CLI batch path. As of the most recent verification pass, the audit records emitted by the CLI do not match the defined schema, so this remains an open release blocker.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-26\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Title**: Audit Trail Logging\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- SHA-256 hash is computed for every input stream and captured in the audit record.\\n\\n- Companion JSON schema pairs the input hash with the redaction map for each processed file.\\n\\n- Audit-log generation is wired into the CLI batch path.\\n\\n- CLI-em